flowchart TD
    accTitle: Rendering synchronization domains
    accDescr: Server command dispatch, CPU worker tasks, and GPU queue completion are different synchronization domains.
    Caller[Main or loading thread] -->|server API| Dispatch[Dispatch wrapper]
    Dispatch -->|caller is server thread| Direct[Direct operation]
    Dispatch -->|queue required| Queue[CommandQueueMT]
    Queue -->|pump and flush| Server[Server thread]
    Direct --> Work[Retained state and resource work]
    Server --> Work
    Work -->|CPU preparation| Workers[WorkerThreadPool tasks]
    Workers -->|task completion| Work
    Work -->|RD recording| Graph[Command graph]
    Graph -->|submit| GPU[Native GPU queues]
    GPU -->|fence completion| Retire[Frame reuse and resource retirement]
    Caller -.->|server sync waits for queue progress| Queue
